          "y_axis": "GHG emissions per capita (t CO2e)",
          "x_axis": "Years 2000-2022",
          "legend": [
            "Low-income",
            "Lower-middle-income",
            "Upper-middle-income",
            "High-income"
          ],
          "trends": "High-income countries show a gradual decline from approx. 15 t CO2e in 2000 to approx. 12 t CO2e in 2022. Upper-middle-income countries show a gradual increase from approx. 5 t CO2e in 2000 to approx. 8 t CO2e in 2022. Low-income and lower-middle-income countries remain relatively flat and low, below 4 t CO2e."
        },
